{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-types-pricing","title":"合同类型与计价方式（总价·成本加酬金·GMP）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/contracts-procurement-risk/contract-types-pricing","wordCount":2206,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"合同类型与计价方式-总价-成本加酬金-gmp\">合同类型与计价方式（总价·成本加酬金·GMP）</h1><p>签合同那一刻，业主和承包商其实是在决定一件事：谁来扛超支的风险。同样一栋楼，用固定总价签，超支算承包商的；用成本加酬金签，超支算业主的；用 GMP 签，则在某个封顶线之内算业主、之上算承包商。计价方式不是会计科目的选择，而是把整条造价不确定性曲线在两方之间切了一刀——刀切在哪，决定了招标怎么报价、过程怎么结算、争议怎么打。本篇拆解这条切线的三种主流位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把计价方式按「价格是否随实际成本浮动」排成一条谱系，从最固定到最浮动依次是：固定总价、固定单价、GMP（最高限价的成本加酬金）、纯成本加酬金。越靠固定端，承包商承担的成本风险越大、报价里的风险费（或然费）越高；越靠浮动端，业主承担的风险越大，但拿到的是更透明的「开口账本」（open-book）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[计价方式谱系] --&gt; B[固定总价&lt;br/&gt;Lump Sum]&#10;  A --&gt; C[固定单价&lt;br/&gt;Unit Price]&#10;  A --&gt; D[GMP&lt;br/&gt;最高限价成本加酬金]&#10;  A --&gt; E[成本加酬金&lt;br/&gt;Cost-Plus]&#10;  B --&gt; F[承包商扛超支&lt;br/&gt;风险费高/账本封闭]&#10;  C --&gt; G[按实测工程量结算&lt;br/&gt;量变价不变]&#10;  D --&gt; H[封顶内业主扛&lt;br/&gt;封顶外承包商扛&lt;br/&gt;结余分成]&#10;  E --&gt; I[业主扛超支&lt;br/&gt;风险费低/账本透明]\">graph TD\n  A[计价方式谱系] --&gt; B[固定总价&lt;br/&gt;Lump Sum]\n  A --&gt; C[固定单价&lt;br/&gt;Unit Price]\n  A --&gt; D[GMP&lt;br/&gt;最高限价成本加酬金]\n  A --&gt; E[成本加酬金&lt;br/&gt;Cost-Plus]\n  B --&gt; F[承包商扛超支&lt;br/&gt;风险费高/账本封闭]\n  C --&gt; G[按实测工程量结算&lt;br/&gt;量变价不变]\n  D --&gt; H[封顶内业主扛&lt;br/&gt;封顶外承包商扛&lt;br/&gt;结余分成]\n  E --&gt; I[业主扛超支&lt;br/&gt;风险费低/账本透明]</pre><p>下表把三类（再加单价）放在同一组维度下对照——这张表是后续每一节展开的索引。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>固定总价</th>\n<th>固定单价</th>\n<th>成本加酬金</th>\n<th>GMP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本超支风险</td>\n<td>承包商</td>\n<td>双方分担（量归业主、价归承包商）</td>\n<td>业主</td>\n<td>封顶内业主、封顶外承包商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业主造价确定性</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>高（有上限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账本透明度</td>\n<td>封闭</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>全开口</td>\n<td>全开口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用前提</td>\n<td>图纸完备、范围清晰</td>\n<td>工程量清单计价、量难精确</td>\n<td>抢险救灾、技术特别复杂</td>\n<td>边设计边施工、需早开工又要控总价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承包商激励</td>\n<td>越省越赚</td>\n<td>多做多得</td>\n<td>弱（成本越高酬金越多时甚至反向）</td>\n<td>省下的结余分成，激励正向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GC（总承包）酬金在 2026 年商业建筑里大致落在总造价的 3%–8% 区间，而合同结构本身（总价 vs CM-at-risk vs 成本加酬金）会再让酬金上下浮动 1–3 个百分点（<a href=\"https://www.bidflow.visidex.com/articles/gc-fee-benchmarks-2026\">BidFlow GC Fee Benchmarks 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"固定总价-把不确定性塞进风险费\">固定总价：把不确定性塞进风险费</h2><p>固定总价（Lump Sum / Fixed-Price）是承包商以一个事先确定的总价完成约定全部内容，超支自负。在中国法语境下，《建设工程施工合同（示范文本）》把它列为典型计价方式之一，实务上要求图纸完备、范围清晰、工期较短、技术难度不高才宜采用——因为承包商要在投标阶段就把所有风险一次性「打包定价」（<a href=\"https://www.bcebca.org.cn/ShowNews.aspx?id=8555\">bcebca.org.cn</a>）。</p>\n<p>它的代价藏在投标价里。承包商无法把材料涨价、地质异常、设计深化的不确定性甩给业主，只能折算成一笔**或然费（contingency / 风险费）**计入总价。范围越模糊，这笔费用越厚——业主看似买了「确定性」，实则为承包商对冲风险的保守估计买了单。所以固定总价的省钱前提，是范围本身足够确定到风险费可以压得很薄。</p>\n<p>固定总价最容易爆雷的点是<strong>范围边界</strong>。一旦发生超出合同范围的变更，就脱离总价保护、进入变更计价，这也是固定总价合同争议的主战场。一个常被忽视的法律陷阱：把 EPC 总承包合同从「固定单价」中途变更为「固定总价」，可能被认定为背离中标合同实质性内容而无效（<a href=\"https://www.dehenglaw.com/CN/tansuocontent/0008/024205/7.aspx?MID=0902\">德恒律师事务所</a>）——计价方式本身就是中标合同的实质条款，不能私下改换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本加酬金-透明的代价是失控的风险\">成本加酬金：透明的代价是失控的风险</h2><p>成本加酬金（Cost-Plus）按实际发生成本据实报销，外加一笔酬金作为承包商利润。酬金有两种算法：<strong>固定酬金</strong>（一笔定额，与成本脱钩）和<strong>成本百分比酬金</strong>（按总成本的固定比例，通常 10%–20%，视复杂度与市场而定）（<a href=\"https://www.netsuite.com/portal/resource/articles/accounting/guaranteed-maximum-price-contract.shtml\">NetSuite</a>）。</p>\n<p>成本百分比酬金有一个致命的<strong>激励反转</strong>：酬金 = 成本 × 比例，成本越高承包商赚得越多，等于鼓励多花钱。设承包商酬金为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>、实际成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、酬金率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，则纯百分比模式下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = r \\cdot C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial C} = r &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>——业主和承包商的利益方向是相反的。固定酬金模式下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial C} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，至少消除了「越花越赚」，但仍未给出「省钱」的正向动力。</p>\n<p>正因如此，成本加酬金在中国实务里被限定在窄场景：抢险、救灾，以及技术特别复杂、开工时无法准确估算成本的工程（<a href=\"https://www.bcebca.org.cn/ShowNews.aspx?id=8555\">bcebca.org.cn</a>）。它的唯一卖点是承包商风险极低、可以立刻开工，代价是业主几乎完全暴露在成本失控之下——除非给它装上一个封顶，那就成了 GMP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gmp-给成本加酬金装上封顶与分成\">GMP：给成本加酬金装上封顶与分成</h2><p>GMP（Guaranteed Maximum Price，最高限价）是成本加酬金的「带刹车」版本：承包商按实际成本加酬金结算，但承诺总价不超过一个事先保证的上限，除非业主主动变更范围才会调整这条线（<a href=\"https://getbuilt.com/blog/understanding-the-4-common-construction-contracts/\">Built</a>、<a href=\"https://www.documentcrunch.com/blog/gmp-construction-contract\">Document Crunch</a>）。它把成本加酬金的透明度和固定总价的确定性各取一半：业主拿到「不会超过 X」的承诺，同时仍享有开口账本。</p>\n<p>GMP 的灵魂是<strong>结余分成（shared savings）</strong>。若最终实际成本加酬金低于封顶线，差额（结余）按事先约定比例在双方之间分配，常见区间从 50/50 到 70/30、通常偏向业主（<a href=\"https://www.millernash.com/industry-news/shared-savings-clauses-contracting-for-cooperation-rather-than-confrontation\">Miller Nash LLP</a>、<a href=\"https://www.sage.com/en-us/blog/gmp-contract-construction/\">Sage</a>）。这一条把成本加酬金的激励反转扭了回来：省钱承包商也能分一杯羹，于是它有动力控成本而非堆成本。</p>\n<p>设封顶价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，实际成本加酬金为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，业主分成比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A &lt; G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 时结余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = G - A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，承包商额外得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-\\alpha)\\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，业主收回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\ge G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 时承包商额外所得为 0，超出部分由承包商自掏。承包商的总收益曲线因此是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>收益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{收益} = F + (1-\\alpha)\\cdot \\max(G - A,\\ 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条带封顶的分段曲线正是 GMP 既控住业主上限、又激励承包商省钱的数学根源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[确定 GMP 封顶价 G] --&gt; P[施工按实际成本据实报销]&#10;  P --&gt; Q{实际成本+酬金 A 与 G 比较}&#10;  Q --&gt;|A 小于 G| R[产生结余 S = G - A]&#10;  Q --&gt;|A 大于等于 G| T[超出部分承包商自负]&#10;  R --&gt; U[按约定比例分成&lt;br/&gt;常见 50/50 至 70/30 偏业主]\">flowchart TD\n  S[确定 GMP 封顶价 G] --&gt; P[施工按实际成本据实报销]\n  P --&gt; Q{实际成本+酬金 A 与 G 比较}\n  Q --&gt;|A 小于 G| R[产生结余 S = G - A]\n  Q --&gt;|A 大于等于 G| T[超出部分承包商自负]\n  R --&gt; U[按约定比例分成&lt;br/&gt;常见 50/50 至 70/30 偏业主]</pre><p>实务里要盯紧三处定义：<strong>哪些算合格结余</strong>（通常排除未动用的或然费和业主指令削减的部分）；<strong>封顶价以何为基准</strong>（图纸深度不够时封顶价就是空的）；以及<strong>变更如何调整封顶线</strong>——只有业主指令的范围变更才允许上调，承包商自身的成本失误不能借此抬高 GMP（<a href=\"https://www.millernash.com/industry-news/shared-savings-clauses-contracting-for-cooperation-rather-than-confrontation\">Miller Nash LLP</a>）。GMP 因此特别适配「需要早开工、又要控总价」的边设计边施工（CM-at-risk）模式——该交付模式如何让施工经理在设计期介入并按 30/60/90% 里程碑给出 GMP，详见<a href=\"../fundamentals-delivery/project-delivery-methods\">项目交付模式</a>。</p>\n<p>值得澄清一个常见误解：FIDIC 2017 的黄皮书（Plant &amp; Design-Build）与银皮书（EPC/Turnkey）都是<strong>固定总价</strong>合同，而非成本加酬金或 GMP——它们靠的是设计建造一体下的总价包干与风险分担，而不是开口账本加封顶（<a href=\"https://fidic.org/books/epcturnkey-contract-2nd-ed-2017-silver-book\">FIDIC 银皮书</a>、<a href=\"https://www.lexisnexis.co.uk/legal/guidance/fidic-contracts-2017-price\">LexisNexis</a>）。把 EPC 等同于 GMP 是采购阶段的典型踩坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计价方式的本质是<strong>成本超支风险在业主与承包商之间的切分线</strong>，从固定总价（承包商全扛）到成本加酬金（业主全扛）是一条连续谱系。</li>\n<li><strong>固定总价</strong>用一笔或然费换确定性，前提是图纸与范围足够清晰；范围边界与变更计价是争议主战场，且计价方式属中标合同实质条款，不能中途私换。</li>\n<li><strong>成本加酬金</strong>透明但风险失控，百分比酬金存在「越花越赚」的激励反转（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial C} = r &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），仅适配抢险救灾与技术特别复杂的窄场景。</li>\n<li><strong>GMP</strong> 用封顶价控住业主上限、用结余分成（常见 50/50 至 70/30 偏业主）重建省钱激励，是成本加酬金与固定总价的折中，最适配 CM-at-risk 边设计边施工。</li>\n<li>选型先问三件事：图纸深度够不够（不够别用固定总价）、要不要早开工（要就考虑 GMP）、业主能否承受开口账本的管理成本（不能就回到总价）。</li>\n<li>FIDIC 黄/银皮书是固定总价而非 GMP——采购阶段务必区分「设计建造一体的总价包干」与「开口账本加封顶」两种完全不同的风险结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合同类型与计价方式（总价·成本加酬金·GMP）","id":"合同类型与计价方式-总价-成本加酬金-gmp"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"固定总价：把不确定性塞进风险费","id":"固定总价-把不确定性塞进风险费"},{"level":2,"text":"成本加酬金：透明的代价是失控的风险","id":"成本加酬金-透明的代价是失控的风险"},{"level":2,"text":"GMP：给成本加酬金装上封顶与分成","id":"gmp-给成本加酬金装上封顶与分成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"挣值管理（EVM）与绩效控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm/earned-value-management"},"next":{"title":"采购与招投标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/contracts-procurement-risk/procurement-and-tendering"}}